        <p>SPECIAL ACT OF PARLIAMENT. MR. WOOLFE JACKSON, 2, SYDNEY PLACE, (BROOK STREET), CHESTER. Has been duly Licensed by the Board of Trade 0 Adranc Cash In Sums from</p>
        <p>£5 To £5OO • To all respectable Householders. Farmers, Cow Keepers, and all others ; any distance; to be repaid by easy payments to suit borrowers' convenience. Having done business in this district for 10 years, which is ample proof of the honourable way my business is conducted. Call or write for prospectus. which is given or sent gratis. All letters receive my prompt attention, and the money is advanced at the borrower's owsi residence, thus saving the trouble of a journey. No bonds men or sureties are required, only borrower's own signature</p>
