        <p>Prolaationera.—Claas I (Prizotaker) : M grave. Class IL: C Duckworth. Holy J, War- rington ; M C Siincock. St Paul, I, Warrington. Candidates.—Class I (ordinary) ; M Whittle, St George, Parochial, Warrington ; M Wright, Fairfield, H.G., Parochial, Warrington. C asi It : E Alker Vulcan Foundry, I ; J Cook, St. Mary, G., Widnes A. Daintith, FairfiFld, 1., Parochial, Warrington ; M Egan, Vulcan Foundry, MA Knott, Orford ; M O'dfi S Paul, G , Warring• ton ; L Taylor, Fairfield. Parochial. HG.. G., Warring- ton. Class 111. : G Jones, Fairfield, Parochial, G., Warrington ; E Wad; worth, Fairfield, Parochial, L, YVarrington ; M Walk Etletimeto-strest, Parochial, I Warrington ;S 4%ll:tiler, St, Ann, Jun., Warrington. First Year —Class I (Prize-takers) • G A Hudson, Warrington, Parcohial, Fairfield, G. ; F M Liddiard, Warrington, Parochial, Smith-street ; L J Lloyd, Fair- field Parochial, 1., Warring,ton ; G M Hankinaon, S. Paul, G., Warring,tan. elms I. (Ordinarv) : E Bt. George Parochial, Warrington ; M J Eiisoa, Fary- worth, I. ;ME Eidson, Earleatowo ?Amor, J.. E Harri- son, Newtan-in-Makerfield, S. Peter, I. ; 8 Houghton, Earleatown. I. ; M Jordan, Orford ; B E L-• ye. Astitnn Rectory ; M Nield, Fairfi..l4l Parochial, H War- rington ; M Rylands, St. Mary, G., Widnes ; P Taylor, Ellesmere Parochial, Warrington ; Class HI. : M Buttorton, Orford ; A E Winskill, Ditton. Sacond Year.—Class I.(Priz •-"akers).—Yeornans. Practising, G, Warrington ; A R L.diard, Parochial Fairfield. G, Warrington. Class I (ordinary) : RCr tik, Parochial, St George, Wavington ; F Kenning. Earlas- te ern ; E Pennington, St Peter, Warrington ; F Sutton, Earlestown; M Taylor,Hollinfare. Class H : E Arnold, St Ann, Jun, Warrington J Arstall, Hollinf are ; C Broadhurst, Holy Trinity, Warrington ; E Clarke, St Mary, I, W•cinsi ;M E Igar, S An. S.ri, Wa, .rington ; N Jenks, Holy Trinity, I, Warrington ; A Joss, St Barnabaa. I, ‘Varring•o ; D Weston, Parigate ; Whittle, Parochial, Elleamere-str